            "Training set: 70 samples\n",
            "Test set:     30 samples"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Step 5A: Build and Train the Model\n",
        "\n",
        "We instantiate with `add_polynomial=False` (standard linear regression).\n",
        "\n",
        "**What happens inside `fit()`:**\n",
        "1. `prepare_features()` adds a constant column of 1s via `sm.add_constant()`\n",
        "2. NaN rows are filtered out\n",
        "3. `sm.OLS(y, X).fit()` runs the OLS estimation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# Build and train the linear model\n",
        "linear_model = LinearRegressionStatsmodels(add_polynomial=False)\n",
        "linear_model.fit(X_lin_train, y_lin_train)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Print the full summary\n",
        "linear_model.print_summary()"
      ]
