        "## ✅ Final Summary & Best Practices\n",
        "\n",
        "### What We Covered\n",
        "\n",
        "| Topic | Key Takeaway |\n",
        "|-------|-------------|\n",
        "| **Statsmodels OLS** | Provides full statistical inference (p-values, CIs, F-tests) |\n",
        "| **add_constant()** | Must prepend intercept column manually |\n",
        "| **PolynomialFeatures** | Creates degree-2+ terms automatically |\n",
        "| **Train/Test Split** | Always evaluate on held-out data |\n",
        "| **Assumption Checks** | Shapiro-Wilk (normality), Durbin-Watson (autocorrelation), Breusch-Pagan (homoscedasticity) |\n",
        "| **Diagnostics Plots** | Residuals vs predicted, Q-Q plot, histogram |\n",
        "| **Model Saving** | Use `joblib` for persistence |\n",
        "\n",
        "### Checklist for Production Deployment\n",
        "1. ✓ Validate all OLS assumptions (residual plots, statistical tests)\n",
        "2. ✓ Check for multicollinearity (VIF < 5 for all features)\n",
        "3. ✓ Compare train/test metrics to detect overfitting\n",
        "4. ✓ Document coefficients and interpretations\n",
        "5. ✓ Version-control your model files\n",
        "6. ✓ Set up monitoring for prediction drift\n",
        "\n",
        "### When to Use This Template\n",
        "\n",
        "✅ **Use for:**\n",
